| medium | 1,000,003 | 8 | 36,000,108 | 8 | locally verified |
| hard | 10,000,019 | 8 | 360,000,684 | 8 | configured shipping preset; locally verified |

The graph is represented by 28 affine rules rather than materializing hundreds
of millions of vertices. Escalation grows the prime field and adds a color, so
the haystack grows while the witness remains far below the output cap.

