The required oracle service is externally blocked: all four script-controlled retries returned HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded,” so the harness correctly aborted without counting any model failure or issuing a hardness verdict. I will not fabricate those transcripts or convert an infrastructure failure into a paper rejection. I’m completing the local report and README with this status so the workspace is ready to resume immediately when the OpenRouter quota is restored.
