The Track B family composes exact native n-fraction identities from the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/1807.00507). Local results:

- All local gates pass.
- Exact density: 1 valid answer among 2,687,385,600 candidates.
- Random guesses: 0/200,000.
- Reference decoder: median 2,955,550 operations.
- Compact route: 293 operations.
- Four attacks: 0/8 successes each.
- Answer: 18 elements, 37 characters.

