Equation~\eqref{eq:specification_with_lcm} is
modeled by the following constraint expressed in terms of the
variables $d_i$ introduced in the model as described in
Section~\ref{section:lcm_constraints}.
%
We encode Equation~\eqref{eq:problem_specification} as 
\begin{equation}
 \sum_{i=1}^n x_i\times d_i = L
\end{equation}
For the \bee\ syntax see Figure~\ref{modelpart4}.


