| bare | 0 / 0 | four retries returned OpenRouter HTTP 403; harness aborted |
| structural hint | 0 / 0 | not run because the bare shipping preset is unknown |
| placebo hint | 0 / 0 | not run because the bare shipping preset is unknown |

Hinted minus placebo is therefore undefined, and no conclusion about the intended
decomposition intuition is warranted yet. The required resumption command is:

